cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QUANTA2 in research, teaching, or other work, please cite this repository and the exact commit you used."
type: software
title: "QUANTA2: Embedded Quantum Wave Simulation Laboratory"
authors:
  - name: "Vice13th"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/Vice13th/QUANTA"
abstract: >-
  QUANTA2 is an experimental classical embedded-computing project that
  visualizes selected one-dimensional quantum-mechanics concepts on an
  Arduino UNO R3 using a compact discrete wave-packet model and an I2C OLED.
keywords:
  - Arduino
  - embedded systems
  - numerical simulation
  - quantum mechanics education
  - wave packet
  - scientific software
